      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bare ase Peori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abaisraeli batoorete agwo Sitimu, abanto bagachaaka gokora obotomani n’abakuungu b’Abamoabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo bakarangeria Abaisraeli bagende ase emeyega y’ebing’wanso yarenge gokorerwa chinyasae chiabo, na barabwo bakabiria, naende bagasasiima chinyasae chi’Abamoabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bakabwatana n’enyasae yarenge korokwa Baali‐Peori, bakayesasiima. Omonene akaba n’endamwamu enene ase bare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agateebia Musa, “Renta abatang’ani bonsi b’Abaisraeli, obasunge agwo ase obosio bwane erioba ribasambe, erinde endamwamu yane enene etige Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Musa agateebia abagaambi b’Abaisraeli, “Kera oyomo ase more, tiga aite abanto baye bonsi baria babwatanire na Baali‐Peori.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoisraeli oyomo agacha akarentana omokungu oyomo bw’Abamidiani ase eamate yaye, ase obosio bwa Musa amo nomoganda bwonsi kobateneine agwo ase egesoero ki’Eema y’Omosangererekano, bakorera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Finehasi, mosinto bw’Eleazari o Aroni Omokuani, akaimoka korwa ase omoganda bw’Abaisraeli, akabogoria ritimo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabwatia omonto oria gochia ase akanyomba ka ime, akababeta ritimo bonsi babere, Omoisraeli oria amo nomokuungu oria, ase chinda chiabo. Ase igo amaakwa aria agatiga goita Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abanto abakwete ase ogoakwa okwo nigo babete chilifu emerongo ebere na inye (24,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agakwana na Musa, akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Finehasi, mosinto bw’Eleazari o Aroni Omokuani, nere ogera endamwamu yane yatigire Abaisraeli, ekiagera ere aba ne risemi buna inche inde ne risemi ase egati y’ abanto aba. Ase ayio tinasiretie bonsi ase risemi riane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, moteebie ng’a, ’ngokora inde nere okobwatana kwane kw’omorembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okobwatana okwo kw’omorembe ’nkobe ase are ere, na ase ororeria rw’aye, okobwatana kwa botambe kw’obokuani, ekiagera abeete ne risemi ase engencho yane, inche Nyasae oye, naende agakora okobwatanigwa ase Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoisraeli oria oitetwe amo nomokuungu Omomidiani nigo arenge korokwa Simuri, mosinto o Salu, omotang’ani bw’eamate yaye ase egesaku gia Simioni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokungu oria bw’Abamidiani oitetwe ere nigo arenge korokwa Kosibi. Suri ise nere orenge omotang’ani bwe chiamate chinde chi’Abamidiani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agakwana na Musa, akamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Umokera Abamidiani, obasirie,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera barabwo baabachandire ase okobaebereria gosasiima Peori, na ase amang’ana a Kosibi, omosubati oria bw’omonene bw’Abamidiani. Omosubati oria obo oitetwe ase rituko riria amaakwa achete ase engencho ya Peori.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
